    "catalog:tags": "basin, wash basin, accessible, wheelchair, wall-hung, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Accessible wall-hung basin with a shallow bowl set back, a lever tap and the trap set back to the wall. rim 0.72, underside 0.45; the front shelf leaves knee space clear under 0.67. Parts under radius 0.04 build as polygonal prisms at true size.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Approved Document M and BS 8300-2 via the drafting standard key dimensions: rim 0.72 (720 to 740 in secondary summaries; documents not read), clear under 0.67 unverified; 0.60 x 0.55 practice size, unverified. Port sizes from the drafting standard (BS EN 12056-2 conventions), unverified",
